---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

// Fusiona About + Bio del sitio actual (duplicadas). Texto original.
// Photo: Landon and Robin (tools/Landon+and+Robin.jpg → public/img).
---
<Base
  locale="en"
  currentKey="about"
  title="About NODNAL"
  description="NODNAL is a resource for self-transformation: healing arts offerings and a personal blog. Meet Landon Kinsey."
>
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h1 data-reveal>About NODNAL</h1>
    <p class="lede" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .1s">
      This website is a resource for self-transformation and contains two websites within
      one: formal offerings of the healing arts and a personal blog.
    </p>
    <p data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .2s">
      Professional offerings include trauma-safe 1:1 coaching, yoga events and guided trips
      into the wilderness.
    </p>
    <h2>Landon's Bio</h2>
    <div class="bio-grid" data-reveal>
      <div class="bio-text">
        <p>
          In Landon's mid-20's a rather unexpected spiritual awakening came, awakening him from
          the process of identifying and defining himself as a separate thing, and awakening him
          to his unique way of being in the world. In the months and years that followed this
          initiation into his True Nature, Landon invariably found himself spending long
          durations of time, periods alone, in nature. Later on he began exploring the world of
          contemplative practices and rites of passage.
        </p>
        <p>
          Landon is a regular practitioner of seated meditation and finds the extensive yoga
          tradition to be the most wholesome form of self-care and illness prevention. He is a
          veteran, a mountain and rock climber, speaks Spanish, writes regularly and plays a
          traditional flute. He resides in Ecuador and frequents North America.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="bio-photo">
        <img
          src="/img/landon-robin.jpg"
          alt="Landon Kinsey sitting outdoors with his dog Robin"
          width="1400"
          height="1101"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <figcaption>Landon and Robin</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <h2>Certified</h2>
    <ul class="certs">
      <li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 0s">
        <!-- Seal / accreditation -->
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="24" cy="19" r="11" /><path d="M17 28 L14 42 L24 37 L34 42 L31 28" /><path d="M19 19 l4 4 l7 -8" /></svg>
        <span>Trauma-Safe Coach</span>
      </li>
      <li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .12s">
        <!-- Lotus -->
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 38 c-10 0 -17 -6 -17 -12 c5 -2 11 0 14 5" /><path d="M24 38 c10 0 17 -6 17 -12 c-5 -2 -11 0 -14 5" /><path d="M24 38 c-5 -5 -6 -12 0 -20 c6 8 5 15 0 20 Z" /></svg>
        <span>Tantra Yoga (300 hours) and Pranayama (50 hours)</span>
      </li>
      <li data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .24s">
        <!-- Mountain -->
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 38 L18 14 L27 28 L33 20 L44 38 Z" /></svg>
        <span>Wilderness Backpacking Guide</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="cta-row" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: .3s">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/en/events/">Explore events</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <style>
    .wrap { max-width: 72rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 0; }
    .narrow > * { max-width: 68ch; }
    .narrow > .bio-grid { max-width: 54rem; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem); margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
    h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem; }
    .lede { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    /* Bio block: text + photo of Landon and Robin. */
    .bio-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: start;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .bio-text { display: grid; gap: 1rem; max-width: 68ch; }
    .bio-text p { margin: 0; }
    .bio-photo { margin: 0; }
    .bio-photo img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .bio-photo figcaption {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      font-family: var(--font-ui);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.03em;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-align: center;
    }
    /* Certifications: vector badge + staggered cascade entrance. */
    .certs {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }
    .certs li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.7rem;
    }
    .certs li svg {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      color: var(--brand);
    }
    /* CTA: subtle lift with expanded shadow. */
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: var(--font-ui);
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--brand);
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition:
        transform 0.25s ease,
        box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 14px 26px -12px rgba(125, 42, 209, 0.65);
    }
    [data-theme='dark'] .btn-primary { color: var(--on-brand); }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .bio-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .bio-photo { max-width: 20rem; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .btn-primary:hover { transform: none; box-shadow: none; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
